Dead systemd-inhibit child was never noticed: engage() returned early on non-None proc, held was proc is not None, release() terminated without wait().\n\nChanges in nixos/services/power-guard/power-guard.py:\n- held reflects poll() is None for real child (stub unchanged).\n- engage() checks poll on existing child; on dead child logs exit status loudly, reaps via wait(), clears and re-engages.\n- release() reaps via wait() (terminate then wait with kill fallback; dead child reaped without terminate), logs exit status.\n- Child stderr stays DEVNULL (sleep infinity is silent); exit status logged loudly on death/diagnosable from journal per acceptance OR-branch.\n\nTests in test_power_guard.py (InhibitorDeadChildTests):\n- dead child detected, re-engaged, exit logged, reaped\n- live child undisturbed\n- stub path unchanged\n- release reaps live + already-dead (no terminate on dead, exit logged)\n\nVerified: python3 -I nixos/services/power-guard/test_power_guard.py -v → 13 tests OK.\n\nTask 14266 (repo-health-code-pilot, worker repo-worker-code).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796810676&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8025&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8025&signature=7f854008e37345ccda9e95a2c7134497534c51ec9a76d51ec6a8da0527f6978f\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8025?autoLogin=true&ref=co